s the new damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标会感受到你造成的所有光系和暗影伤害的回响，持续 %d 回合。\n\n每造成 1 点光系伤害，目标便会减速 %0.2f%%，持续 %d 回合；减速上限为 %d%%，造成 %d 点伤害时达到上限。\n暗影伤害会在目标所在格产生一个持续 %d 回合的效果，每回合造成该次伤害的 %d%%。在微光回响生效期间，只要目标继续受到此效果或其他来源的伤害，该地块效果就会刷新；剩余伤害和新伤害会一并分摊到新的持续时间内。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"87ea154a1537993ca8a75dddacf966b3c968a14d0b6cad6b06a3f2f15f3ecba1","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5f00c907dbc13ab6ab60cc5a87276b438e80239aff1634d9c4468316a5609072","logical_entry_identity":"ee5e7220cecdd8c2c2fa7363040aabde2ec527d0cd182b929237b96907235e89","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"rock","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"岩石"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c2a241f83749b7494887b6a6f7e006172c5a23ddeea3770230b1a7bac955602e","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"5f09026cf8a95c873be8fb91057bcbb3d4661c7e0936a10f16388c4c0c25b677","logical_entry_identity":"fa7c7a6124cd34832d4ceb26892f6efcaff17b025d560edbf580653b6820a1aa","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"lightning","source_tag":"effect subtype","target":"闪电"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"15ff73ff47faabc8c5d279b963d37a005507355939875b8b8fd8cd438a6c0bf2","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6017ccb28e1b046d659b0c00bea67e60d05d62e3048d512ab56fb6772f574b61","logical_entry_identity":"d298ba1b7ce86f9cca63a1760b7be7c6e7cfd626fc6c6bfabb46f606919553e8","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"halfling","source_tag":"entity subtype","target":"半身人"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c5b346d780505f7ff143b7b27bae079853d33f50b9224b440da57a6c3370c359","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"6023fc2a3923ccdb4e3df6fbc5eea2b63e995017c76bb4185b6359623c85f1b8","logical_entry_identity":"2a1dcbfe902133c542fe54d2b690d38528c1fc3bff39e6d488021f6b52de2fe7","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"This door seems to have been sealed off. You think you can open it.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这扇门似乎被封住了，你觉得你可以打开它。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d3d98529541f874ae74a41ea02